{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2815,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.salco.themercenary",
  "name": "ODIN - THE MERCENARY",
  "slug": "odin-the-mercenary",
  "teaser": "The legendary, barely beatable mercenary is back.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/acwv6SNndy0u2pSRF4cz7UQL2YFcajt2gyMDm1kk.png",
  "downloads": 2404,
  "favourites_count": 17,
  "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://postimg.cc/8J863kcV\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/0Qj0zbqr/Odin-The-Mercenary-Modbild.jpg\" alt=\"Odin-The-Mercenary-Modbild.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ABOUT THE MOD</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>ODIN - THE MERCENARY</strong> is a mod that brings the legendary mercenary back into the game to make life difficult for you.\nWhat’s more, this mod includes exclusive items that are only available on ODIN.\nBefore starting a raid, you’ll receive a notification in the bottom right-hand corner if ODIN spawns in your round.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Back up your profile before every update!!!</li>\n<li>Delete every previous version <strong>completely</strong>!!!</li>\n<li>Clear your caches!!!</li>\n<li>Download the mod!!!</li>\n<li>Extract the ZIP!!!</li>\n<li>Copy the <strong>contents</strong> of the ZIP into your <strong>SPT root folder</strong>!!!</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Step 1:\nGo to: SPT\\BepInEx\\patchers and delete TheMercenaryPrepatch.dll</p>\n<p>Step 2:\nGo to: SPT\\BepInEx\\plugins and delete the folder TheMercenary</p>\n<p>Step 3:\nGo to: SPT\\SPT\\user\\mods and delete the folder TheMercenary aswell</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">WEB UI</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://postimg.cc/Hrn5Jd5L\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/dVm9x0VG/WEB-UI.jpg\" alt=\"WEB-UI.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p>First start the server, then open your browser at <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6970/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6970/</a> to access the configuration options. Click “Save &amp; Apply” after every change.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ABOUT ODIN</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://postimg.cc/5Qm1JgmY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2ChnJH/Health.jpg\" alt=\"Health.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>HUNT MODE</strong><br />\nIf you’re a truly hardened, no-nonsense bastard, press F12 in-game to activate Hunt Mode.\nODIN will switch to Berserker Mode and hunt you down until you croak.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>SAIN</strong><br />\nTHE MERCENARY, like other bots, is fully configurable via SAIN.</p>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">MIMIMI</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Ladies and gentlemen, or whatever you choose to identify as, I’m not interested in your whingeing about ODIN being too strong. In the past, ODIN was even stronger, and I’ve already backtracked to tone him down a bit.\nOnly download this mod if you’re truly experienced and not afraid to die. Because you will. Often.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">REPORT BUGS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>There are two ways to report bugs:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>My own thread on Discord: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521957836928848032\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521957836928848032</a></li>\n<li>In the ‘Issue’ tab on GitHub: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/S4LCO/TheMercenary/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/S4LCO/TheMercenary/issues</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>I need a clean log.</li>\n<li>A list of your installed mods.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Bug reports without logs will be ignored.</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SUPPORT ME</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you like the mod, feel free to send some donation. 🫶🏼</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/salco1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/salco1</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2815/odin-the-mercenary",
  "fika_compatibility": true,
  "featured": false,
  "contains_ads": false,
  "contains_ai_content": true,
  "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>AI was used as a development assistant to help modernize the original mod, troubleshoot compatibility and build issues, and review parts of the code and documentation. The original concept, design, assets, configuration, and creative decisions are my own. All changes were reviewed and tested manually in game.</p>\n",
