      "description": "<p><strong>Added:</strong></p>\n<p>New Bounty System<br />\nKilling allied bots now gradually increases your bounty. If it exceeds the set threshold, Odin will appear and immediately start hunting you – regardless of the normal HuntMode. A brief message will announce that the bounty hunt is active. You can set the value yourself in the UI.</p>\n",
